WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.870
(audience cheering and clapping)

00:00:00.870 --> 00:00:01.770
- All right, y'all.

00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:04.260
We are back, and we always
love to shine a light

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:07.140
on Broadway shows making
their mark here in the city.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:10.530
These days, "Kimberly Akimbo"
has been the talk of the town,

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:13.740
earning five Tony's last
year, the most of any show,

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:15.360
including Best Musical.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:17.580
The show follows a
teenager with a condition

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:20.520
that causes her body to
age faster than it should.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.100
So she goes through all
those trials and tribulations

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:26.280
of adolescence looking
like a 72-year-old woman,

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:28.080
and that's just the starting point.

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:29.010
Now, performing though,

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:32.340
the hopeful Act 1 finale, "This Time",

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:35.011
give it up for the cast
of "Kimberly Akimbo."

00:00:35.011 --> 00:00:37.154
(audience cheering and clapping)

